{#
	Shared mega menu mechanism: one overlay, one dropdown container with a
	fixed height/width. Panel 1 (category column, one block per top-nav
	trigger, all sharing identical class names/structure) and Panel 2 (shared,
	swapped in from the <template> blocks below) are plain children of the
	same container/track rather than independently-positioned panels, so the
	whole thing always reads as one box instead of two stitched-together ones.
#}
<div id="mega-menu-overlay" class="mega-menu-overlay" data-mega-menu-close hidden></div>

<div id="mega-menu-dropdown" class="mega-menu-dropdown" hidden>
<div class="mega-menu-track">
