	{# ---------------- Standard Tools ----------------
		Mirrors /products' own taxonomy and drill-down (Category > Material > Shape),
		pulled directly from master_series_data + views/woo/product-index-*.php (the
		same source /products itself renders from -- see page-products.php). Shape
		links point at /products#category/material/shape, which product-index-filter.js
		reads on load and replays as clicks to land on that exact pre-filtered view.
		Burrs and Miscellaneous have a Material tier but no Shape tier in the source
		data, so their materials link straight to /products#category/material. Inserts
		and Armory have no breakdown at all in the source data, so they link straight
		to their /products tab. #}
